为简化多语言框架部署到 Aone FaaS，我们提供了通用打包工具，下载地址如下：

本工具只适用于自定义 Runtime `custom.debian10`，不适用于 Rapis 

| Linux X64 | [https://faas.io.alibaba-inc.com/tools/pack.linux-amd64](https://faas.io.alibaba-inc.com/tools/pack.linux-amd64) |
|-|-|
| Mac (Intel) | [https://faas.io.alibaba-inc.com/tools/pack.darwin-amd64](https://faas.io.alibaba-inc.com/tools/pack.darwin-amd64) |
| Mac (Apple Silicon) | [https://faas.io.alibaba-inc.com/tools/pack.darwin-arm64](https://faas.io.alibaba-inc.com/tools/pack.darwin-arm64) |

打包工具默认支持 python/node 应用，启动 server[.ext] 或 dist/server[.ext] 文件，具体逻辑参见：[https://code.alibaba-inc.com/node-harmony/faas-io/blob/master/tools/pack/bootstrap.go#L18](https://code.alibaba-inc.com/node-harmony/faas-io/blob/master/tools/pack/bootstrap.go#L18)

构建脚本示例如下：

```
#!/usr/bin/env bash

# 执行构建逻辑

echo "------------- build.sh packing at $(date +%Y/%m/%d\ %H:%M:%S) ------------"

curl https://faas.io.alibaba-inc.com/tools/pack.linux-amd64 -o /tmp/pack && \
  chmod +x /tmp/pack && /tmp/pack

# 压缩 built-functions 目录
cd .serverless
zip -rq ../code.zip *
cd ..

ZIP_SIZE=$(stat -c "%s" code.zip)

# 完成构建
echo "------------- build.sh end at $(date +%Y/%m/%d\ %H:%M:%S) ------------"
echo "Built app.zip size: ${ZIP_SIZE}"

```
如果你需要启动 python/node 的其他文件，可以可以在 `f.yml` 中定义 `package.entry` 字段，例如：

```
service: [appname]

provider:
  name: fiber

package:
  entry: custom-server.js
```


